WEBVTT

00:02:29.875 --> 00:02:34.309
And it's not just stories in general
that we are attuned to,

00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:37.851
but particular narrative structures.

00:02:37.875 --> 00:02:43.268
There are a number of basic plots
that we use again and again,

00:02:43.292 --> 00:02:47.893
and in politics there is one basic plot

00:02:47.917 --> 00:02:52.101
which turns out to be
tremendously powerful,

00:02:52.125 --> 00:02:55.083
and I call this "the restoration story."

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.333
It goes as follows.

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:01.518
Disorder afflicts the land,